WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
I finally found him again

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,680
Why can't we always stay together?

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,190
Your name is Sun Chengyi

4
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:09,270
I didn’t expect you to see through it. It’s so boring that you hacked me to death.

5
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:10,710
This old bitch owes me

6
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:12,070
It's natural for me to find her

7
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,230
Sun Tieniu

8
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:14,550
Do you want to be shameless?

9
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,900
You were a bandit in your last life

10
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,700
You burned, killed and looted

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,900
Lin Yueling was a farmer's wife in her previous life

12
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,220
I was robbed by you and taken to the mountain to be your wife.

13
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,060
Now you say she owes you

14
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,040
Where did you get your face?

15
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,320
That happened in the previous life

16
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,880
She promised me this life

17
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,800
She agreed to the teacher Sun Chengyi

18
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,520
Not the bandit Sun Tieniu

19
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:42,850
The ghosts and fairies in my house

20
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,780
Sun Tieniu

21
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:54,480


22
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:55,930
Why are you still here?

23
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:57,250
Sent by the humble king

24
00:00:57,570 --> 00:00:59,890

